---
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: Helvetica
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Wearable Device
    participant A as ALERT
    participant D as Dispatch Strategy Selector
    participant F as Family Member
    participant I as INCIDENT

    W->>A: Trigger Alert (FALL_DETECTED)
    A-->>A: Alert Triggered (PENDING_CONFIRMATION)
    Note over A: policy: Fall Confirmation Timeout (20 s)
    A->>A: Confirm Alert
    A-->>A: Alert Confirmed
    A->>D: severity = CRITICAL
    D->>A: Broadcast Alert
    A-->>A: Alert Broadcasted (BROADCAST · PUSH + SMS)
    F->>A: Acknowledge Alert
    A-->>A: Alert Acknowledged
    Note over A,I: policy: Escalation Stopper
    A->>I: Open Incident
    I-->>I: Incident Opened (IN_ATTENTION)
